    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >! Regarding Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The launch version of this game on August 17th will temporarily only support <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>. We plan to release <strong>English</strong> and <strong>Japanese</strong> versions within 1-2 weeks, so please be patient~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >! Regarding Gameplay Videos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kindly request that you wait <strong>one week after the game's release</strong> before posting your gameplay videos online. Thank you for your understanding!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >! Regarding the macOS Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to limited testing resources, the macOS version may contain undiscovered bugs. If you encounter any issues, please feel free to report them (via the QQ group or email). We will work to fix them as soon as possible. Thank you for your understanding!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines AVG (Adventure Game) and RPG (Role-Playing Game) adventure gameplay. Players will experience the full story from the perspectives of different characters, leading to various endings based on the choices they make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine the relationship dynamics and fates of Till, Ivan (classmate), and Ivan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sensitive Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains potentially disturbing elements, including: dual-body phenomenon (i.e., a single character from the original work appears in two different forms), gore, non-human/alien species, immoral/unethical themes, human modification, and sexual crimes. Please ensure you are comfortable with this content before playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Team</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Work:</strong> Alien Stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Team:</strong> StudioLico / VIVINOS&amp;Qmeng</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production Circle:</strong> \u5c9a\u5a1c36\u53f7</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Script/Art/Director:</strong> \u5948\u5a1c </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development/Music/Art:</strong> \u806a\u660e\u5c9a</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a derivative fan game of &quot;Alien Stage,&quot; produced by the doujin circle &quot;\u5c9a\u5a1c36\u53f7&quot; (L\u00e1n N\u00e0 36 H\u00e0o). The game is distributed for free. Sharing or reselling it for profit is strictly prohibited.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >! Regarding Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The launch version of this game on August 17th will temporarily only support <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>. We plan to release <strong>English</strong> and <strong>Japanese</strong> versions within 1-2 weeks, so please be patient~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >! Regarding Gameplay Videos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kindly request that you wait <strong>one week after the game's release</strong> before posting your gameplay videos online. Thank you for your understanding!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >! Regarding the macOS Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to limited testing resources, the macOS version may contain undiscovered bugs. If you encounter any issues, please feel free to report them (via the QQ group or email). We will work to fix them as soon as possible. Thank you for your understanding!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines AVG (Adventure Game) and RPG (Role-Playing Game) adventure gameplay. Players will experience the full story from the perspectives of different characters, leading to various endings based on the choices they make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine the relationship dynamics and fates of Till, Ivan (classmate), and Ivan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sensitive Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains potentially disturbing elements, including: dual-body phenomenon (i.e., a single character from the original work appears in two different forms), gore, non-human/alien species, immoral/unethical themes, human modification, and sexual crimes. Please ensure you are comfortable with this content before playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Team</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Work:</strong> Alien Stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Team:</strong> StudioLico / VIVINOS&amp;Qmeng</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production Circle:</strong> \u5c9a\u5a1c36\u53f7</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Script/Art/Director:</strong> \u5948\u5a1c </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development/Music/Art:</strong> \u806a\u660e\u5c9a</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a derivative fan game of &quot;Alien Stage,&quot; produced by the doujin circle &quot;\u5c9a\u5a1c36\u53f7&quot; (L\u00e1n N\u00e0 36 H\u00e0o). The game is distributed for free. Sharing or reselling it for profit is strictly prohibited.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a fan-made game for &quot;Alien Stage,&quot; created as a tribute to the world of &quot;The Song of Saya.&quot; It is a coupling-focused game centered on the &quot;IvanTill&quot; pairing.",
